1
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:29,300
It's you.

2
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:32,700
You saved me.

3
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:55,670
This is my jade pendant.

4
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,130
Where did this jade pendant come from?

5
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:01,770
I've had it with me since I was born.

6
00:01:04,940 --> 00:01:06,620
Tang Nianzi is your father?

7
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:08,800
Yes, he is.

8
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:11,460
And you are?

9
00:01:16,460 --> 00:01:18,860
Just an old acquaintance of your father's.

10
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:28,460
Thank you.

11
00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:36,660
Young Master, Madam is missing.

12
00:01:37,060 --> 00:01:38,000
Idiots.

13
00:01:38,479 --> 00:01:40,140
You can't even handle such a small matter.

14
00:01:40,140 --> 00:01:42,240
Young Master, Madam was rescued.

15
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:45,800
Who would be so bold?

16
00:01:49,940 --> 00:01:50,539
What?

17
00:01:52,300 --> 00:01:53,759
Are you telling the truth?

18
00:01:53,940 --> 00:01:55,070
I wouldn't dare lie.

19
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:01,000
It's actually him.

20
00:02:44,980 --> 00:02:46,140
I don't want to see you anymore.

21
00:02:46,140 --> 00:02:46,940
Let me in.

22
00:02:47,340 --> 00:02:48,120
Are you going to let go?

23
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:48,640
No.

24
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:54,460
Hurry up and leave.

25
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,600
Open the door.

26
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:03,140
Are you going to take care of this?

27
00:03:03,140 --> 00:03:04,270
How am I supposed to?

28
00:03:04,780 --> 00:03:05,880
Honestly,

29
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:07,000
how could you be so careless?

30
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:07,960
My fault.

31
00:03:12,140 --> 00:03:12,940
Ma'am.

32
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:15,980
You be the judge.

33
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:17,800
I was taking a shower in my room last night,

34
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:19,140
when a woman suddenly barged in

35
00:03:19,140 --> 00:03:20,220
and kicked me out.

36
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,400
Look, she even took my pants.

37
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:23,840
Don't you think she is

38
00:03:23,860 --> 00:03:25,740
completely unreasonable?

39
00:03:26,180 --> 00:03:27,460
Let me tell it again.

40
00:03:28,040 --> 00:03:29,240
She was...

41
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:30,680
Come in first.

42
00:03:30,940 --> 00:03:31,880
I haven't finished yet.

43
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:33,280
Sorry about that, ma'am.

44
00:03:34,740 --> 00:03:37,270
Take your things and leave my house right now.

45
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,500
Leave?

46
00:03:38,820 --> 00:03:40,820
You've seriously affected my life.

47
00:03:41,340 --> 00:03:42,400
How did I affect it?

48
00:03:42,880 --> 00:03:44,740
I don't need to explain anything to you.

49
00:03:44,740 --> 00:03:45,840
Just looking at you

50
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:46,640
makes me sick.

51
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:49,400
Sick?

52
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:53,860
Do you know who you're talking to?

53
00:03:54,940 --> 00:03:56,270
I don't care who you are.

54
00:03:56,579 --> 00:03:57,520
Just leave.

55
00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:00,500
Rascal.

56
00:04:01,060 --> 00:04:02,040
Who's a rascal?

57
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:03,560
You.

58
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,380
Aren't you?

59
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:07,380
Who got drunk last night

60
00:04:07,380 --> 00:04:09,040
and made a scene on the street?

61
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:11,810
I took off your shoes and poured you water.

62
00:04:12,340 --> 00:04:14,040
Not only did you throw up all over me,

63
00:04:14,040 --> 00:04:15,440
but you also call me sick.

64
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,529
You really have no manners.

65
00:04:17,980 --> 00:04:19,040
Who has no manners?

66
00:04:19,140 --> 00:04:19,600
You.

67
00:04:22,079 --> 00:04:22,720
Fine.

68
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:25,540
I apologize for causing you trouble.

69
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:27,370
Thank you for taking care of me.

70
00:04:27,380 --> 00:04:30,510
But it's really inconvenient for you to stay at my house.

71
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:32,340
I'm asking you to leave my house now.

72
00:04:32,340 --> 00:04:33,180
Get out.

73
00:04:33,420 --> 00:04:34,280
Get out!

74
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,610
Don't think I won't do anything to you.

75
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:41,060
If your father hadn't begged me

76
00:04:41,060 --> 00:04:42,320
and made a deal with me,

77
00:04:42,340 --> 00:04:44,540
do you think I'd want to take care of you?

78
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,780
What deal?

79
00:05:00,300 --> 00:05:01,230
Hello, Mr. Ling.

80
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:03,140
Make some time this afternoon.

81
00:05:03,140 --> 00:05:04,070
I want to see you.

82
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:06,800
Okay, see you this afternoon.

83
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:14,870
What did you mean by what you just said?

84
00:05:16,200 --> 00:05:17,180
What deal?

85
00:05:20,140 --> 00:05:21,420
Your father begged me

86
00:05:22,140 --> 00:05:23,870
to take good care of you for him.

87
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:37,940
First of all,

88
00:05:38,740 --> 00:05:40,800
I don't need anyone to take care of me.

89
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:45,880
Secondly, it's really inconvenient for me to have you in my house.

90
00:05:45,880 --> 00:05:47,940
From now on, please stay away from me.

91
00:05:55,780 --> 00:05:57,140
This is your own choice.

92
00:05:57,840 --> 00:05:58,640
As you wish.

93
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:26,200
Please calm down.

94
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:28,240
The child spoke out of anger.

95
00:06:28,740 --> 00:06:30,180
You can't just leave like this.

96
00:06:30,180 --> 00:06:32,980
What will she do without you?

97
00:06:33,280 --> 00:06:35,680
Let me apologize to you on her behalf, okay?

98
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:40,340
Give me the key.

99
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:42,880
What?

100
00:06:46,180 --> 00:06:46,980
The key.

101
00:06:50,580 --> 00:06:51,380
No.

102
00:06:52,080 --> 00:06:54,340
You haven't fulfilled your promise yet.

103
00:06:54,380 --> 00:06:55,940
She gave up on her own.

104
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,040
No.

105
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:01,080
I can't give it to you.

106
00:07:10,900 --> 00:07:11,700
No.

107
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:35,140
Coming back this time,

108
00:07:35,440 --> 00:07:38,370
I still haven't collected any very strong evidence.

109
00:07:38,540 --> 00:07:40,600
I'll take the opportunity of him asking me out

110
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:42,480
to see if there's another way

111
00:07:42,980 --> 00:07:44,940
to get closer to Lingze.

112
00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:54,240
Help me think about

113
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:56,240
where we should go for dinner later.

114
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:00,900
I'm talking to you.

115
00:08:30,380 --> 00:08:30,960
Mr. Ling.

116
00:08:32,280 --> 00:08:33,780
Did you ask me out alone

117
00:08:33,780 --> 00:08:35,400
just to stare at me?

118
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:37,659
I thought you came to talk about work.

119
00:08:39,580 --> 00:08:40,159
What?

120
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:43,020
Can't I ask you out if it's not about work?

121
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:44,800
Of course not.

122
00:08:45,800 --> 00:08:47,640
I'm just a little surprised.

123
00:08:50,340 --> 00:08:52,380
Actually, I've always been curious

124
00:08:52,940 --> 00:08:55,070
about what kind of girl you really are.

125
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,280
Me?

126
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,840
I'm just an ordinary,

127
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,300
average girl.

128
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:04,940
You are highly professional.

129
00:09:06,180 --> 00:09:08,480
You should have had many choices back then.

130
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:10,880
Why did you ultimately choose our company?

131
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:15,720
Isn't it because

132
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:17,200
you, the boss, pay well?

133
00:09:20,180 --> 00:09:20,880
Mr. Ling,

134
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:24,220
you're not saying this because of layoffs, are you?

135
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:26,240
Of course not.

136
00:09:29,180 --> 00:09:31,700
I asked you out just to get to know you better.

137
00:09:36,700 --> 00:09:37,460
Can we

138
00:09:38,580 --> 00:09:39,740
be friends?

139
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:43,480
I thought we were already friends.

140
00:09:45,540 --> 00:09:47,360
Then can I trust you?

141
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:48,840
Of course you can.

142
00:09:52,780 --> 00:09:53,580
Alright then.

143
00:09:54,340 --> 00:09:56,470
I have something I need your help with.

144
00:10:05,380 --> 00:10:06,840
This is my private matter.

145
00:10:07,680 --> 00:10:09,540
Because she insulted my parents,

146
00:10:10,180 --> 00:10:12,080
I hit her.

147
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:15,480
Help me handle it.

148
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:18,040
However much money you want,

149
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:19,280
just name your price.

150
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:22,140
I roughly understand the situation.

151
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:27,200
Mr. Ling.

152
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:29,740
Since we are already friends,

153
00:10:30,040 --> 00:10:32,970
there's no need to talk about price when helping out.

154
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:36,340
I'll take care of this for you.

155
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:38,600
As for the reward,

156
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,540
just treat me to a meal.

157
00:10:43,640 --> 00:10:44,240
That's it?

158
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:45,280
That's it.

159
00:10:45,740 --> 00:10:47,940
It's not a very difficult thing anyway.

160
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:52,400
Alright then.

161
00:10:52,980 --> 00:10:54,040
How about tonight?

162
00:10:55,640 --> 00:10:56,440
Sure.

163
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:58,180
Come,

164
00:10:58,180 --> 00:10:59,880
let's have a drink.

165
00:11:02,140 --> 00:11:02,960
Sit here.

166
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:04,080
Let me do it.

167
00:11:11,540 --> 00:11:12,220
Boss.

168
00:11:12,820 --> 00:11:14,140
Coming.

169
00:11:16,160 --> 00:11:17,460
Long time no see.

170
00:11:17,460 --> 00:11:18,240
Yeah.

171
00:11:19,640 --> 00:11:21,100
What would you like today?

172
00:11:22,380 --> 00:11:23,320
The usual.

173
00:11:27,140 --> 00:11:27,940
Just a moment.

174
00:11:31,980 --> 00:11:33,040
What did you order?

175
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:34,200
It's a secret.

176
00:11:34,560 --> 00:11:35,880
You'll know in a bit.

177
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:42,880
Here's the porridge. Enjoy.

178
00:11:48,800 --> 00:11:49,940
Eat slowly.

179
00:11:49,940 --> 00:11:52,070
It's a bit hot since it was just served.

180
00:12:00,280 --> 00:12:01,120
How is it?

181
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:04,880
Right?

182
00:12:46,180 --> 00:12:48,240
How was it? I sang pretty well, right?

183
00:12:58,240 --> 00:12:59,970
Do you want to be my girlfriend?

184
00:13:12,640 --> 00:13:14,080
Are you sure you don't need me to drive you in?

185
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:15,600
No need. The road inside is narrow.

186
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:17,130
It's hard for cars to get in.

187
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:19,040
Okay, get some rest.

188
00:13:19,740 --> 00:13:20,720
Drive safely.

189
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:34,780
Watch where you're going!

190
00:13:34,780 --> 00:13:35,600
I'm sorry.

191
00:13:44,040 --> 00:13:46,080
Hey beautiful, all alone this late?

192
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:48,130
- Let me take you home.
- No need.

193
00:13:48,940 --> 00:13:50,260
Don't be so polite.

194
00:13:50,740 --> 00:13:52,140
We live in the same neighborhood.

195
00:13:52,140 --> 00:13:52,780
Let me take you home.

196
00:13:52,780 --> 00:13:53,640
I already

197
00:13:53,640 --> 00:13:54,980
said no.

198
00:13:56,580 --> 00:13:57,160
Get in.

199
00:13:57,160 --> 00:13:58,220
What are you doing?

200
00:13:58,400 --> 00:13:58,840
Nothing.

201
00:13:58,840 --> 00:13:59,840
Stay away from me.

202
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:00,980
Why so aggressive?

203
00:14:00,980 --> 00:14:01,980
I'm just kindly offering you a ride.

204
00:14:01,980 --> 00:14:02,860
Get lost!

205
00:14:06,780 --> 00:14:08,080
Who are you, kid?

206
00:14:08,520 --> 00:14:09,240
Get lost!

207
00:14:15,140 --> 00:14:16,540
Mind your own business.

208
00:14:20,880 --> 00:14:21,600
Are you okay?
